.TH dslite-b4-status 8  "status "
.SH NAME
dslite\-b4\-status \- Show the last status snapshot written by the daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdslite\-b4 status\fR [\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-state\-dir\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show the last status snapshot written by the daemon
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-config\fR \fI<CONFIG>\fR [default: /etc/dslite\-b4.toml]
Read configuration from this path
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print the complete status snapshot as JSON
.TP
\fB\-\-state\-dir\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Read status from this runtime state directory
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
